Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,Thank you for watching the Gentlemen of the Hàn fansubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:06.28,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,5000,5960)\pos(640,424)}Episode 84 \N\N\N\N\NThree Divided United By Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:12.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6000,6000)\pos(461.333,196)}Spirit Tablet of\NZhuge Kongming\Nthe Late Teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:38.00,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4800,5200)\pos(994.286,440)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.45,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I, Jiang Wei, am inept.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:40.59,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I have misled the nation and the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:44.27,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,failing to meet your expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:48.13,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Chancellor, may your spirit in Heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:50.94,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:09.82,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I, Jiang Wei, may be short of talent and wisdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.62,0:01:13.22,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,but my loyalty is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:25.20,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I shall defend the Late Emperor's legacy to my death!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.78,0:01:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.44,0:01:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:43.26,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I have a plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:46.80,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,... that can restore the Han dynasty from the dark back into the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,General, what is the stratagem? Please specify.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:51.39,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Surrendering to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:01:55.74,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:02:02.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5160,5520)\pos(976,452)}Zhōng Huì\NStyled: Shìjì
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:01:59.50,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Invite him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:24.36,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Boyue, why have you come so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:31.97,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The safety of the state and the army rested upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:37.89,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}That I came here today is quick enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:11.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4400,4800)\pos(296,334.667)}Jiàngé Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:29.53,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,General, I have heard that you have made many accomplishments since you set out from Huainan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.55,0:03:32.92,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,The Sima Clan's position now is all thanks to your efforts, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.64,0:03:37.43,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,For this, I, Jiang Wei, submit willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:41.75,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,If it were Deng Ai, I would have fought to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:43.72,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,How could I surrender to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:51.31,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,After a few days, I learned that\N you have great acumen and insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.31,0:03:53.22,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,This I greatly admire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:00.26,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,As fate would have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:03.64,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,I wish to swear an oath of brotherhood with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:06.89,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,What are your thoughts, General?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:11.72,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I dare not disobey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:17.57,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Get me an arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:26.76,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,I now become sworn brothers with Boyue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:30.08,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Should I have duplicity, may my fate be like this arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:38.57,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, please accept your younger brother's respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:42.53,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Younger Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:45.08,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:48.78,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Please continue to command your retinue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:50.96,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,and participate in military discussions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:53.46,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,As you say, Younger Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:05:02.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5600,6000)\pos(368,460)}Dèng Ài\NStyled: Shìzǎi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.85,0:05:04.10,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,How dare that kid Zhong Hui accept \NJiang Wei's surrender and vie for honors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:08.93,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Father, I heard that they have become sworn brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.93,0:05:11.97,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,He has commanded Jiang Wei to command his original forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:16.13,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,It seems that Zhong Hui is recruiting confidants and buying support.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:18.14,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,He must be fomenting a conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:28.18,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Issue this command:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:30.45,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Make Liu Shan the King of Fufeng and return him for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.45,0:05:33.32,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Give the Shu officials positions based on their rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:36.77,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,{\bord12}issue a notice to calm the people, and hand over the warehouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:37.38,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Shi Zuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:37.86,Default,Shi Zuan,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:40.68,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}You are the Overseer of Yi Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:43.32,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Qian Hong, Wang Ji, and other generals shall govern the commanderies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:47.40,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Build a platform in Mianzhu to our victory and prepare a feast with the officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:50.35,Default,Shi Zuan,0,0,0,,Huang Hao caused much discontent. How should he be dealt with?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.35,0:05:51.93,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,He sold out his state for glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:53.36,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Why keep him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:55.65,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Execute him by slow slicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.65,0:05:56.21,Default,Shi Zuan,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:56.98,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:00.89,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Report our victory to Luoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:03.04,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,I shall write a letter to the Duke of Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"With Shu pacified, you should turn to conquer Wu."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"You should treat Liu Shan well to show a message to Wu."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"For now, make Liu Shan the King of Fufeng."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"When Wu hears this, they will fear our might and virtue."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"Then, they will surrender quickly..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:25.71,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}That Deng Ai dares boast of \Nhis glory and empower himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:31.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2160,2600)\pos(426.667,457.333)}Jiǎ Chōng\NStyled: Gōnglǚ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:35.20,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Your Highness, do you recall that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.54,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}not long ago, you promoted Deng Ai and his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:42.62,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You sent a letter explicitly stating\N that without first sending a memorial,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:44.76,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}they could not take any action.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:48.89,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}After Deng Ai read the letter, he dared to say:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:51.78,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"A general in the field does not need to obey orders."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:54.61,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}He also said: "I have total power for an expedition;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:56.26,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}why obstruct me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:57.64,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,Deng Ai has become too proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:07:00.61,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,His arbitrary behavior exposes his rebellious intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:04.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4080,4440)\pos(944,438.667)}Sīmǎ Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐshàng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.61,0:07:04.17,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,What can be done about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:08.56,Default,Shào Tì,0,0,0,,Your Highness, why not give Zhong Hui more titles...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:08.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2440,2760)\pos(332,347)}Shào Tì
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:12.81,Default,Shào Tì,0,0,0,,... in order to keep Deng Ai and his son in check?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:24.12,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,Congratulations on becoming Minister of the Masses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:25.92,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Army Supervisor Wei Guan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:33.17,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,The Duke of Jin wrote this letter, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.67,0:07:38.83,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,The Duke of Jin said:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:41.82,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Deng Ai has become too proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:46.01,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}His arbitrary behavior exposes his rebellious intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:50.77,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He orders us to watch over Deng Ai to guard against any of his actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:00.42,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Oh, Boyue?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:01.56,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.06,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Younger Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:05.48,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:19.15,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Deng Ai's achievements are far greater than ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:21.47,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}and he is now the Grand Commandant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.47,0:08:25.08,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Today, the Duke of Jin suspects that Deng Ai has rebellious intent,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.20,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}so he has sent Wei Guan as Army Supervisor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:29.34,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}and orders me to curb Deng Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:32.48,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Boyue, what are your esteemed thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:40.30,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}I have heard that Deng Ai is of low birth, herding cows in a farming family when he was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:42.85,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}He snuck through Yinping by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:48.33,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If it were not for our standoff at Jiange, \Nhow could he have made such an achievement?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.61,0:08:53.66,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Today, by naming the Lord of Shu as King of Fufeng, he is trying to befriend the people of Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:57.04,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Even without words, his rebellious intent is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:59.78,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The Duke of Jin is most correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:03.32,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Exactly. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:07.59,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,When Marquis Wu first left his thatched cottage,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:10.54,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,he gave this map to the Late Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.47,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,General, get a candle and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:25.36,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang, Marquis Wu, had said:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:28.09,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,"Yi Province has many acres of fertile land."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:31.44,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,"With its workers and prosperity, it is\N a strong area to vie for hegemony."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:36.32,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Because of this, the Former Lord established his dynasty at Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:40.16,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Now that Deng Ai is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:41.90,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,how could he not become arrogant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.33,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,How can we eliminate Deng Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.80,0:09:59.05,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}While the Duke is still suspicious, submit a memorial
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:00.60,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}about Deng Ai's rebellious conduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.72,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The Duke will order you to attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:04.98,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}He will be captured in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.55,0:10:07.82,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:16.73,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You should also order someone to intercept the man carrying Deng Ai's letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:21.60,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}copy the handwriting and rewrite the letter with arrogant words, and then send it to the Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:25.83,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:29.22,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:33.49,Default,Zhōng Huì,0,0,0,,If we do this, why worry that\NDeng Ai will not be ruined?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:36.72,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,Deng Ai that baseborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:41.09,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,With such arrogance and disrespect in his letter, his heart is clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:44.18,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,Please calm down, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:45.64,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,Jia Chong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:48.16,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,-Here. \N-Send thirty thousand troops to Ji Gorge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.16,0:10:50.82,Default,Jiǎ Chōng,0,0,0,,I worry things are changing on Zhong Hui's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.34,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,I will figure it out once I get to Chang'an. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:53.82,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:11:01.82,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,Your Highness, are you leading the troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:07.39,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,I am accompanying the Emperor's campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:13.67,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Send someone to Zhong Hui's camp for Deng Ai's arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:14.44,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:22.97,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Greetings, Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:27.66,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Boyue?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.82,0:11:32.23,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,By the warrant of the Duke of Jin, \NDeng Ai ought to be arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:34.71,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,How should it be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:43.44,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Army Supervisor Wei Guan can be sent there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:46.22,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Should Deng Ai kill Wei Guan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:48.47,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,he only confirms his rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:50.81,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Then, he could be punished by military force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:56.98,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Call in Army Supervisor Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.91,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Army Supervisor Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:07.36,Default,Wei Guan,0,0,0,,I, Wei Guan, greet you, Your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:12.15,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,General, please lead some troops to Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:15.53,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Arrest Deng Ai and his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:17.53,Default,Wei Guan,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:20.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3080,3440)\pos(352,484.571)}Wèi Guàn\NStyled: Bóyù
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:21.82,Default,Wei Guan,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:25.64,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2000,2360)\pos(290.286,464)}Luòyáng
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:34.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(387.429,470.857)}Cáo Huàn\NStyled: Jǐngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.87,0:12:42.85,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Mount!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:52.33,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui has six times more troops than Deng Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.81,0:12:54.38,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,He has enough to arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:57.39,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,Your Highness, why join the campaign?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:01.66,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,You said that Zhong Hui would rebel one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:07.09,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Today, I am not going for Deng Ai, \Nbut for Zhong Hui.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:11.46,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,I thought that you had forgotten that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:12.88,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,hence my inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.05,0:13:18.89,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Keep my intentions confidential. Do not divulge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:25.93,Default,General,0,0,0,,Sir, we are going straight into a tiger's mouth\N just to confirm that Deng Ai is rebelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.93,0:13:27.52,Default,General,0,0,0,,You must not go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:34.26,Default,Wei Guan,0,0,0,,Give this manifesto to the riders \Nand have them enter the city overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:36.47,Default,Wei Guan,0,0,0,,Tell them to distribute it in Deng Ai's camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.47,0:13:36.85,Default,General,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:42.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3000,3320)\pos(956,473.333)}Chéngdū
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:45.18,Default,Wei Guan,0,0,0,,Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:46.38,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Greetings, Supervisor Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:10.16,Default,Wei Guan,0,0,0,,I am here to arrest Deng Ai and his son by edict!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.05,0:14:19.77,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Who are you? This is mutiny! Let me go! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.45,0:14:24.27,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui, you baseborn, you dare oppress your elders!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:30.13,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui, you wretched pig! You dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:30.99,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:32.66,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:34.13,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,You dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.13,0:14:34.62,Default,Deng Zhong,0,0,0,,You pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:42.86,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Traitor bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:46.20,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,You snuck through Yinping and got away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.79,0:14:48.43,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Here we are now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.09,0:14:54.08,Default,Deng Ai,0,0,0,,Now a lost swine dares to shoot his mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:02.81,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I should have killed you on the battlefield, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:09.98,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Put Deng Ai and his son into the cage wagons to Luoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:11.77,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Duke of Jin will handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:15.38,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Each soldier shall stay in the army for further orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:19.23,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Everyone shall drink for three days, all will be rewarded!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:34.58,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Today is the day that I have always wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.38,0:15:41.57,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Now that you have won glory and recognition, you have also terrified your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:48.98,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: A reference to Zhang Liang, the strategist for Liu Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:45.74,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Why not row away in a raft, \Nhike to the peak of Mount Emei,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.74,0:15:48.98,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,and follow the great Immortal on his trips?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.95,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Surely you jest, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:53.40,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,I am barely forty in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:57.08,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,It is still my time, how can I retire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:02.61,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Should you not retire, \Na plan must be made soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:04.92,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Your Excellency!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:12.00,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Minister Zhong, a silk letter from the Duke of Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:22.85,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}This is written by the Duke of Jin himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:30.78,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"I fear that you might not be able to arrest Deng Ai, so I am garrisoned at Chang'an."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:33.83,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"As we will soon meet, I impart you with this news."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.61,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The Duke of Jin is garrisoning Chang'an?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.17,0:16:42.51,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}I have many more troops than Deng Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.51,0:16:45.29,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Arresting Deng Ai and his son \Nwas as easy as flipping my palm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:49.10,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The Duke of Jin, knowing this, is leading troops here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:53.04,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}He must suspect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:17:00.27,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}When a lord suspects a servant, the servant will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.27,0:17:03.16,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Indeed, Deng Ai is an example of what is to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.38,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}My mind is set.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:09.49,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Should my deed succeed, the realm is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:12.27,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Should it not, then I shall retreat and guard Western Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.27,0:17:14.89,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}There, I may be another Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:18.66,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}I heard that Empress Dowager Guo has died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:20.56,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}You can claim that she has left an edict
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:24.29,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}so you can fight Sima Zhao \Nby punishing him for regicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:28.28,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}General, through your talents,\N you can easily pacify the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:32.48,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Yuanxiao Festival (元宵節): The fifteenth day of the first month of the Chinese\N calendar. Also known as Shangyuan Festival (上元節) or "Lantern Festival."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:31.91,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Tomorrow will be the Yuanxiao Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.43,0:17:39.71,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The palace can be decorated with lights and lanterns for the officers to revel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:43.96,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}And anyone who refuses...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:49.02,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Come, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:55.94,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,Minister, now is the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:58.24,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,Shall we beat the drums to add to the ambiance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:01.63,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:02.14,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:09.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4140,4500)\pos(896,357.333)}Qiū Jiàn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:10.51,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,It is time! Beat the drums!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:25.49,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:30.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3040,3400)\pos(957.333,465.333)}Hú Liè\NStyled: Xuánwǔ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:32.75,Default,Hu Lie,0,0,0,,Your Excellency, what is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:39.82,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:45.52,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Empress Dowager Guo, upon\N her death, has left this edict.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:58.11,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao, in his treachery, will usurp the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:00.56,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,For this, she has commanded me to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:09.44,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,I ask you honorable gentlemen\N to sign your names to a pledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.44,0:19:11.26,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,to all fight the traitor together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:30.34,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:35.09,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,He who opposes... dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:06.18,Default,Hu Lie,0,0,0,,General Qiu, for the sake of our friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.43,Default,Hu Lie,0,0,0,,please send a letter to my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:10.54,Default,Hu Lie,0,0,0,,My son Hu Yuan leads troops outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.91,0:20:13.36,Default,Hu Lie,0,0,0,,He will see my sword as my proxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:18.33,Default,Hu Lie,0,0,0,,Tell him that we can see each other \Nno more after next morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:21.89,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,Rest assured, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.82,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,I, Qiu Jian, shall live up to your trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:27.31,Default,Hu Lie,0,0,0,,Good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.09,0:20:33.74,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,I notice that the officers are not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:37.12,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,General, please make a decision soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:41.58,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,I shall dig a pit in the palace grounds\N and prepare thousands of clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:45.13,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Any violators will be beaten to death and buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.35,0:20:55.06,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Imprison the officials in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:56.97,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Let nobody out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:20:58.72,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.58,0:21:00.16,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:10.29,Default,Hu Yuan,0,0,0,,My father is in great danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.96,0:21:11.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2160,2480)\pos(314.667,414.667)}Hú Yuān\NStyled: Shìyuán
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:12.53,Default,Hu Yuan,0,0,0,,What should we do now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:17.19,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,General Hu, hurry to Supervisor Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.43,0:21:22.58,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,Contact all the commanders of the camp \Nto rescue your father and destroy the rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:24.10,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,After tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:26.44,Default,Qiu Jian,0,0,0,,All will be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:34.22,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,All preparations have been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.22,0:21:37.07,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Let each general out and ask them one by one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:39.98,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Why ask them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:41.32,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Just kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:45.71,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Boyue, please do the honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:46.90,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:47.66,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.66,0:21:48.59,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:50.13,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Take the officials to the rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.13,0:21:50.84,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.88,0:21:54.47,Default,Wei Guan,0,0,0,,March out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.47,0:21:55.15,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.15,0:21:55.62,Default,Wei Guan,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.96,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General, everything is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:07.01,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:11.11,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:20.73,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.75,0:22:24.26,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,It must be those generals rebelling. Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:25.66,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Excellency Zhong!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:27.55,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,We are under attack from Supervisor Wei Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.37,0:22:30.74,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Shut the gates, prepare to defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:31.22,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:51.93,Default,General,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:01.21,Default,General,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.21,0:23:04.88,Default,General,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:24.83,Default,General,0,0,0,,Get him alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.85,0:23:49.86,Default,Jiang Wei,0,0,0,,My failure... is the will of Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.74,0:24:41.65,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The downfall of Shu is through no fault of yours, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.65,0:24:45.81,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Blame all on your lord's lack of virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.96,0:24:56.14,Default,Shao Ti,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Bury General Jiang well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.48,0:25:10.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(306.286,445.714)}Liú Shàn\NStyled: Gōngsì
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:12.90,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,With the deaths of Jiang Wei, Zhong Hui, and Deng Ai,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.90,0:25:14.94,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,the Riverlands were pacified.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.94,0:25:20.04,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Liu Shan was escorted to Luoyang and made the Duke of Anle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.04,0:25:23.20,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He went to Sima Zhao's residence to give thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.76,0:26:15.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2920,3360)\pos(297.6,486.4)}Sīmǎ Yán\NStyled: Ānshì
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:57.92,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,Perform the Shu dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.20,0:28:12.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3560,3920)\pos(992,465.6)}Xī Zhèng\NStyled: Lìngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.44,0:28:30.22,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.84,0:28:33.17,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Do you miss Shu or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.34,0:28:39.67,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.42,0:28:43.70,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Do you miss Shu or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.26,0:28:49.57,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}With this entertainment, I do not miss Shu!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.82,0:29:00.33,Thinking,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}How can the heartlessness of man be like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.02,0:29:08.08,Thinking,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If even Zhuge Kongming, when he was alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.08,0:29:12.49,Thinking,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}could not assist him for long, then what of Jiang Wei?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.87,0:29:22.60,Default,Xi Zheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Your Majesty, {\bord12}why did you answer that you do not miss Shu?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.77,0:29:26.64,Default,Xi Zheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If he asks again, you should cry with:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:29.35,Default,Xi Zheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"The graves of my forebears\N are away in Western Shu."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.35,0:29:32.24,Default,Xi Zheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"My heart aches for the west; \Nthere is no day that I do not miss it."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.24,0:29:35.15,Default,Xi Zheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Duke of Jin would then let Your Majesty return to Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.17,0:30:04.46,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.46,0:30:05.73,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.03,0:30:08.72,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.96,0:30:18.46,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Do you really miss Shu or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.65,0:30:25.04,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}The graves of my forebears are away in Western Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.74,0:30:27.78,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}My heart aches for the west,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.06,0:30:33.21,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}and there is no day that I do not miss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.28,0:30:48.02,Default,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Why does this sound like \Nsomething Xi Zheng would say?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.30,0:30:49.38,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Yes yes yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.96,0:30:51.34,Default,Liu Shan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}It was indeed his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.05,0:31:06.98,Thinking,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}He is despicably stupid, though honest too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.98,0:31:08.99,Thinking,Sima Zhao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}I have no more problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:20.68,Default,Sima Yan,0,0,0,,Royal Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.33,0:31:24.73,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.73,0:31:25.46,Default,Sima Yan,0,0,0,,Royal Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.46,0:31:26.64,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.31,0:31:37.23,Default,Sima Yan,0,0,0,,Royal Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.20,0:31:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Royal Father!\N- Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.72,0:32:38.80,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}An auspicious day is before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.80,0:32:43.56,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We entreat the Emperor of Great Jin to ascend the platform,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.56,0:32:47.44,Default,Jia Chong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}and accept the fief of Heaven and Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.02,0:32:54.08,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After Sima Zhao died,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.08,0:32:59.68,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,his son, Sima Yan, forced the Lord of Wei, Cao Huan, to abdicate in his favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.68,0:33:02.16,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thus, the state of Wei fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.50,0:33:07.50,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the first year of the Taishi era, 265 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.50,0:33:09.43,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sima Yan ascended the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.43,0:33:14.93,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He would become known as Emperor Wu of Jin, \Nand his dynasty would be called Great Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.93,0:33:20.61,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the first year of the Taikang era, 280 CE, Jin attacked Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.61,0:33:22.94,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Lord of Wu, Sun Hao surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.94,0:33:25.03,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thus, the state of Wu fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.51,0:34:11.67,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,So ended seventy-two years of chaos \Nbetween the three kingdoms of Wei, Shu, and Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.75,0:34:17.95,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The empire, long divided, has been united!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.42,0:34:57.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.44,0:35:04.64,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k78}Gǔn{\k46}gǔn {\k52}cháng{\k53}jiāng {\k111}dōng{\k129}shì{\k448}shuǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.44,0:35:04.64,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}On and on the Great River rolls, racing east.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.64,0:35:13.84,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k61}Làng{\k69}huā {\k117}táo{\k107}jǐn {\k105}yīng{\k464}xióng
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.64,0:35:13.84,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Of proud and gallant heroes its white-waves leave no trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.88,0:35:22.96,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k67}Shì{\k111}fēi {\k76}chéng{\k104}bài {\k129}zhuǎn{\k242}tóu{\k195}kōng
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.88,0:35:22.96,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}As right and wrong, glory and fall,\N fade at once into unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.08,0:35:27.36,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k69}Qīng{\k63}shān {\k40}yī{\k80}jiù {\k175}zài
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.08,0:35:27.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet ever the green hills stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.44,0:35:33.00,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k85}Jǐ{\k78}dù {\k58}xī{\k64}yáng{\k271}hóng
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.44,0:35:33.00,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}to blaze in the west-waning day.
