Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.52,0:35:48.84,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}White haired fishers and woodsmen, comb on the river isles,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.92,0:35:56.72,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k50}Guàn{\k46}kàn {\k102}qiū{\k103}yuè {\k166}chūn{\k313}fēng
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.92,0:35:56.72,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}looking on the autumn moons and spring breezes.
